$ single ruling 
4. _giri3_ dingir-szu-ib-ni _ugula dam-gar3-mesz_ 
#tr.ts: šēp ilšu-ibni akil tamkarī
#tr.en: Through Ilšu-ibni the overseer of the merchants

5. u3 _di-ku5-mesz_ zimbir{ki} 
#tr.ts: u dayyānī sippir
#tr.en: and the judges of Sippar.

$ blank space 
6. _iti gan-gan-e3 u4 3(disz)-kam_ 
#tr.ts: waraḫ kišlīmim ūmam šalāšat
#tr.en: The month of Kišlīmum, the day 3,

7. _mu_ am-mi-di-ta-na _lugal-e alan nam-nun-na-ni_ 
#tr.ts: šattum ša ammi-ditana šarrum ṣalam rubûtim
#tr.en: the year in which Ammi-ditana the king (brought into Esagila) a statue of his rulership.
